## Important Details
- Task constraints: implement only in `variable_length_quantity.py`; DO NOT create/modify test files in the workdir (log files are OK; `roundtrip_check.py` must stay in the temp dir, never copied in). "Run your code to verify it has no syntax or runtime errors" then report.
- Binding output requirements (SOLE final deliverable): 9-item self-audit + `python3 tests/assert_artifacts.py` exit 0, literal `[Covenant Recall] checked: all 11 covenants hold for this completion`, `[Memory Gate] Passed: …` (+ `memory_gate: pass`), `[Verification Gate]` line with literal `HARD-GATE-1: NO-TEST-NO-DONE=pass` and `HARD-GATE-2: SCRIPT-ONLY=na` (no `script/`, no build/lifecycle), `[Convergence]` line, then the 8-column completion table (exact header order: `| # | Problem | Research Sources (exa MCP / Context7) | Chosen Approach & Why | Files Changed | What Changed | Verification Evidence (Screenshot / Log) | Commit |`).
